# CLI deploys upload the working folder; leave out what the build never needs.
# Run `npm --prefix web run build` right before `vercel deploy`: an older local public/ with different
# hashed names reaches the build and the Python step fails on files Vite has since deleted.
# (A deploy built from git is fine: Flask serves public/ itself when the CDN has no copy.)
.venv/
web/node_modules/
synth/out/
test-results/
playwright-report/
.env*
